THOUGHT: The build output shows my previous sed replacement did not apply; `bindSide` still dereferences `side.glEnum` without a null check. I need to modify just this method to insert `if (side == null) return;` before the framebuffer call, then re-run the compile to confirm the NullAway error count drops from 453 to 452 without introducing new ones.

```bash
cd /home/vscode/nullness-benchmarks/libgdx && sed -i '179,186c\  protected void bindSide(@Nullable final Cubemap.CubemapSide side) {
    if (side == null) return;
    Gdx.gl20.glFramebufferTexture2D(
        GL20.GL_FRAMEBUFFER,
        GL20.GL_COLOR_ATTACHMENT0,
        side.glEnum,
        getColorBufferTexture().getTextureObjectHandle(),
        0);
  }' gdx/src/com/badlogic/gdx/graphics/glutils/FrameBufferCubemap.java && ./gradlew gdx:compileJava -x test -q > new_build_output.log 2>&1 && grep -n "NullAway: .*errors" new_build_output.log || tail -n 60 new_build_output.log
```

